{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110874","id":2858222236,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6qXQKc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110874","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110874.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110874.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110874","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110874/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110874/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110874/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/031c70a179bcddab42d59ab57fc60fad8e3553a1","number":110874,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Metal toolchain detection on macOS/iOS in order for metallib to be properly generated with Shader Baker","user":{"login":"hortopan","id":917773,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzc3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917773?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan","html_url":"https://github.com/hortopan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Problem\r\n\r\nExporting projects with **Shader Packer** enabled failed to generate metalib on macOS/iOS.  \r\n\r\nThis was caused by issues in how the shell command to query the `metal` toolchain was constructed:\r\n\r\n- The exec command string was malformed, so the query always failed.  \r\n- Minimum OS version flags (`-mmacosx-version-min`, `-mios-version-min`) were appended in the wrong position, causing them to be ignored.  \r\n- The exit code from `metal` was not validated correctly.  \r\n\r\nAs a result metalib was not generated,  leading to very long first-load times (e.g. ~60s in the TPS Demo) when no shader cache was present.  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\n- Correctly construct the `metal` toolchain query command.  \r\n- Place min-version flags in the proper position so they are respected.  \r\n- Check and propagate the exit code from `metal`.  \r\n\r\nWith this fix, shaders are baked as intended, significantly reducing startup times as opposed to only SPIRV versions othrewise.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFixes: #110870\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFi